1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,060
A Proposal for Organizing a Speech Contest
关于组织演讲比赛的建议

2
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:10,680
Our student union is planning to hold a speech contest this semester.
我们学生会正计划在本学期举办一场演讲比赛。

3
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,650
Here is my proposal for organizing it.
下面是我关于如何组织这次比赛的建议。

4
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:23,450
The topic of the contest will be “My Dream and My Responsibility,” which encourages students to think about their goals and the role they can play in society.
比赛的主题是“我的梦想与我的责任”，鼓励同学们思考自己的目标以及他们能在社会中发挥的作用。

5
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:30,790
The aim is to improve students’ public speaking skills, build their confidence and make campus life more vibrant.
比赛的目的是提高同学们的公开演讲能力，增强他们的自信，并让校园生活更有活力。

6
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:36,780
The contest will be open to all students, and contestants will be selected in two rounds.
比赛面向全体学生，选手将通过两轮比赛选拔产生。

7
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:42,380
Each department will hold a preliminary round and recommend two speakers for the final.
各院系将举行一轮初赛，推荐两名选手参加决赛。

8
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:49,010
As for the procedure, the final will be held in the university auditorium in late November.
至于比赛流程，决赛将于十一月下旬在学校礼堂举行。

9
00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:55,430
Each contestant will give a five-minute prepared speech and then answer a question from the judges.
每位选手先做一段五分钟的备稿演讲，然后回答评委提出的一个问题。

10
00:00:56,230 --> 00:01:04,870
A panel of teachers will score the speeches based on content, language and delivery, and the top three speakers will receive certificates and prizes.
由教师组成的评审团将根据内容、语言和表达给演讲打分，前三名选手将获得证书和奖品。

11
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:11,610
The contest will be a valuable opportunity for students to show their talents and learn from one another.
这次比赛将是同学们展示才华、互相学习的宝贵机会。

12
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:14,380
I hope my proposal will be helpful.
希望我的建议能有所帮助。
